author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "Every remote write carries a revision assertion, proven by a test that interleaves two writers and asserts the loser fails; work item revisions reconcile with pm item history; typed relations round-trip to pm parent and dependency kinds; a full project sync uses the batch endpoint and its request count is asserted; the credential preflight aborts before any store read or network call; coverage is 100 across statements, branches, functions and lines and the docstring gate passes"
risk: medium
